WEBVTT

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.332
Open Project summary in the private workspace.

00:00:03.332 --> 00:00:08.173
Select the saved B01 revision for the 4 m residential opening.

00:00:08.173 --> 00:00:13.194
The issue cites the measured drawing, page, mark and adopted beam span.

00:00:13.194 --> 00:00:18.276
Check both area loads at 6 m width and the selected 180 PFC section.

00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:24.349
The ultimate moment is 36.13 kNm. Service deflection is 11.94 mm.

00:00:24.349 --> 00:00:28.738
Open the beam appendix in the browser to inspect the native calculation record.

00:00:28.738 --> 00:00:34.180
Read the appendix page by page, or expand the page text on a smaller screen.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:39.395
Return to the issue library and reopen the saved record. Engineering approval remains with the responsible engineer.
